--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Demonstration documents
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The demonstration corpus consists exclusively of official publications from the
French health authorities (HAS) and the French Society of Emergency Medicine
(SFMU). These documents are NOT redistributed in this repository: they remain
the property of their publishers and are downloaded from the source at setup
time. See demo_docs_officiels/SOURCES.md and scripts/fetch_demo_docs.sh.

No patient data, and no document of unverified provenance, is included.

